msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A black liquid spewed out, covering part of her face and armor, and the beast roared again."
msgstr "Чёрная жидкость выплеснулась, покрыв часть её лица и доспехов, и зверь снова взревел."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A black scar, a void, an absence."
msgstr "Чёрный шрам, пустота, отсутствие."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A black, oily tongue, emerged from its mouth, sliding around the body of the Mythran prince, and dragging it into its bowels."
