msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But now, the only thought she had was that it seemed only fair."
msgstr "Но сейчас единственной её мыслью было, что это только справедливо."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But now, with what Dalia had told her, Sarah began to feel alone again."
