msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Caught between his iron body and the stone wall, she could escape in no direction."
msgstr "Зажатая между его железным телом и каменной стеной, она не могла сбежать."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Caught by great momentum, the bodies of both rider and horse were impaled on the unyielding bulwark of spears."
