msgid "During dinner, Sarah would look at her family and smile."
msgstr "За ужином Сара смотрела на свою семью и улыбалась."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "During most of the march, she had seen very little of either. She had been too occupied with many of her own soldiers."
