msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She did her best to comfort herself. Perhaps the citadel would not be so bad."
msgstr "Она изо всех сил пыталась утешить себя. Возможно, цитадель будет не так уж плоха."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She did her best to gather her courage."
