msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't know their voices...but they didn't sound like guards."
msgstr "Она не узнавала голоса... но на стражников они не походили."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't know this man at all."
msgstr "Она совсем не знала этого человека."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't know what had just happened, nor did she intend to find out."
msgstr "Она не знала, что только что произошло, да и не собиралась выяснять."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't know what she had been expecting to see, but it hadn't been this."
