msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't know why she kept screaming the words, or why even those words."
msgstr "Она не знала, почему продолжала выкрикивать эти слова, или почему именно эти слова."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't know why, but felt oddly preferential to the one who had done most of the harassing."
