msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't need to, it was obvious that she had won."
msgstr "В этом не было нужды — и так было очевидно, что она победила."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't offer up any resistance, not even the idea of it."
msgstr "Она не оказала никакого сопротивления, даже мысли о нём не возникло."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She didn't quite agree, but she understood where all this excess was coming from."
